{
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列出我参与的组织（含席位/配额/我的角色）"
,
"en"
:
"List organizations I belong to (with seats/quota/myRole)"
}
}
,
"create"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"创建组织（纯付费：返回 PayPro 结账链接，付款后组织才正式创建）"
,
"en"
:
"Create an organization (payment-first, returns a PayPro checkout link)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"组织名（唯一；仅字母、数字、_、-，首字符须为字母；禁 u- 前缀；创建后不可改）"
,
"en"
:
"Org name (unique; letters, digits, _ and - only, must start with a letter; no u- prefix; immutable)"
}
}
,
"--seats"
:
{
"#synopsis"
:
"<5|10|20|50>"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"席位档，默认 5"
,
"en"
:
"Seat tier, default 5"
}
}
}
,
"cancel"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"取消付款预占并释放名字锁"
,
"en"
:
"Cancel a pending org creation and release the name lock"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
